umns of the data_pca","options":["4","2","3","1"],"answer":"2","image":"/quizzes/Data Science Tools/DST_Images/IntelliJ_Plugin-main_cpp (5).png"},{"numb":46,"type":"Multiple Choices","question":"The resulting data matrix will be of size","options":["3×5","4×4","5×5","5×4"],"answer":"3×5","image":"/quizzes/Data Science Tools/DST_Images/46.jpg"},{"numb":47,"type":"Multiple Choices","question":"The normalized term frequency of tf (''camel'',D1) is","options":["0.20","3","4","0.25"],"answer":"0.25","image":"/quizzes/Data Science Tools/DST_Images/46.jpg"},{"numb":48,"type":"Multiple Choices","question":"The inverse document frequency idf(''Camel'',D)","options":["3","1","1/3","Not Here"],"answer":"Not Here","image":"/quizzes/Data Science Tools/DST_Images/46.jpg"},{"numb":49,"type":"Multiple Choices","question":"What is the tflogidf (''caw'',D)?","options":["0","1","3","5"],"answer":"0","image":"/quizzes/Data Science Tools/DST_Images/46.jpg"},{"numb":50,"type":"Multiple Choices","question":"The resulting distance matrix will be of size","options":["3×5","4 × 4","5×5","3×3"],"answer":"3×3","image":"/quizzes/Data Science Tools/DST_Images/46.jpg"},{"numb":51,"type":"Multiple Choices","question":"The corresponding feature vector of document D1 using binary term frequency is","options":["[1 1 1 0 0]","[1 0 0 0 1]","[1 0 1 1]","[2 1 1]"],"answer":"[1 1 1 0 0]","image":"/quizzes/Data Science Tools/DST_Images/46.jpg"},{"numb":52,"type":"Multiple Choices","question":"The correlation between the data using the new axes z1,z2 is --- than the correlation between the same data with respect to the axes x1,x2","options":["Higher","lower","equals","higher or equals"],"answer":"lower","image":"/quizzes/Data Science Tools/DST_Images/53.jpg"},{"numb":53,"type":"Multiple Choices","question":"Which axis you may neglect to reduce the dimension?","options":["z1","z2","z1 or z2","z1 and z2"],"answer":"z2","image":"/quizzes/Data Science Tools/DST_Images/53.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'computing-data-sciences